{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "606cfd4b9979936173f2c63d00c7aa3c0fcde134e0d278afe3c59329ae6533b6", "ja": "（アイドルゴルフ大会に風花が参加した。\n今日は風花に頼まれて、ゴルフ用品を買いにきた……）", "zh": "（风花参加了偶像高尔夫大会。\n今天受风花所托，来买高尔夫用品……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0ba05779e0a6c6ce0b54a5e3c85eb4da732b2c6f013262561a0939755e00f5e7", "ja": "悩んじゃいますね……胸にネコちゃんのマークが\n入ったウェアも可愛いですけど……。", "zh": "真让人纠结呢……胸前印着小猫图案的服装也很可爱，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "52c1098d62ee65a11380e84566c1cde8f15ff6c94e5953b82bb64c71ed06df0e", "ja": "いっぱいのネコちゃんがプリントされたシャツも\nとっても可愛くて……うう～、決められません！", "zh": "印满了小猫图案的衬衫也特别可爱……呜呜～，真的选不出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4b555fb0000fc4b9ccdcccb8bbb6d85e58d910ac52fa389e2866fcc1f3b9a8ba", "ja": "たしかに、どっちも可愛いな。\n風花にもよく似合ってるし……。", "zh": "确实，两件都很可爱。\n而且都很适合风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ef84068190335ba182c7acea039684082946855498373091e3aba775e5414c20", "ja": "もしゴルフを続けるつもりなら、\n二着くらい持ってた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "如果打算继续打高尔夫，还是准备两套比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5b3770d83b0f63e691d9d5a958696936cbf84a210b45628dde58b40175f5cfd8", "ja": "……そうですよね。{$P$}さんの\n言うとおりです。私、両方買おうと思います！", "zh": "……说得也是呢。正如{$P$}先生所说。我想把两件都买下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "27e27a2a2c648125f3ed9342819b70c822c9ce1307a6a5e2017e602e5b486c47", "ja": "ははっ。風花の力になれてよかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，能帮上风花的忙就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6137fb7937b730b8374605911ea8412383b31b9618780a6d06fc3bc988834c22", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとうございます♪\n実はこの間のゴルフ大会が、すごく楽しかったんです。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您♪其实，前段时间的高尔夫比赛让我觉得特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f0f37c909f707f5764f43cd6386a17fa1ae014af3a7446197c8ffa7d315a6712", "ja": "それに運動にもなるなって。だから続けてみようって\n決めたんですけど……正直、不安で。", "zh": "而且还能锻炼身体。所以我决定继续下去，可是……说实话，我有点不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2148ff8a04f8e6c5094dd063d4d13f75f57db471b6fd7dd3bbf808deff17e6a1", "ja": "そうだな。勢いで始めたものの、三日坊主なんて\nよくあるし。先のことを考えると不安にもなるよな。", "zh": "是啊，虽然一时兴起开始了，但三天打鱼两天晒网这种事也很常见。想到以后的事，确实会感到不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8fab3d2d019f8fb8e3397c1b64d0cfcd4a524d1f786b21592c85d7207eebca84", "ja": "はい……。でも、二着も買いますし、絶対に\n続けなきゃって。頑張る気持ちでいっぱいです！", "zh": "是的……不过，我都买了两套，绝对要坚持下去才行。现在满心都是努力的干劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fc16e417667ddbde7d1f8eb52292e5e1ae6379810eba1a71343c8c7f5d01f805", "ja": "ネコちゃんと一緒なら……。\nゴルフも、もっと楽しめそうです。", "zh": "如果能和小猫一起……  \n打高尔夫似乎也会更开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1012_p", "source_sha256": "90313ccaefeb4ded9a2d653625f5505a3a72e3cf60810eabb01dbcf840d4b74e", "ja": "ははっ、モチベーションは高いみたいだな。でも\n無理はしないように。風花なら大丈夫だと思うけど。", "zh": "哈哈，看来你的干劲很足嘛。不过还是别勉强自己。虽然我觉得风花应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3152f8c15361a014eddb74d67e4384aa574a304a36515bcc63bbec546c224a53", "ja": "もちろんです♪　ウェアのネコちゃんじゃ足りない時は\n……ネコカフェで元気をもらってきます♪", "zh": "那是当然♪　运动服上的小猫还不够的时候\n……我就去猫咪咖啡厅补充活力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7bb9827ba5e99a64d9554731237e37667e553e555bd28b5999e9ec5f32bad77f", "ja": "う、うん……。それならいいんだけど……\nそこまでして続けたい理由が……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那样的话倒是无所谓……\n但让你做到这种地步也想坚持下去的理由是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5a18ce5977e35da1ec0cb2257a6ae24c9eb7f4346f94ade83942b621cd0f7121", "ja": "それは{$P$}さんのせいですよ！？\nグラビアのお仕事が多いから……！", "zh": "都是因为{$P$}先生啊！？因为接了很多写真拍摄的工作……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d1ae3d277d3fbf5e56a32f28f92651c4e5ea634bf5058d73bde55e58bfcb2230", "ja": "ごめん、風花。そんなに気にしてくれてるとは思って\nなくて……これからはもっと意識するよ。", "zh": "对不起，风花。我没想到你会这么在意……以后我会更加注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0563_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "01d4207acdc73a9601ebdceb4ee7a5e9c3f2d03be0a1a692ffe7dfe40ff62360", "ja": "お願いしますね。でも……ふふっ、それだけじゃない\nって言ったら、どんな顔をしてくれるかな？　なんて♪", "zh": "拜托你了。不过……呵呵，要是我说“还不止这些”，你会露出什么表情呢？开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
